    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not really about hobbies though. it feels more like... if you take away the person i was when i was with them, there’s nothing left. like the core of me is just gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's just an empty shell. it feels so heavy to just keep dragging this shell around for no reason.",
