    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"starting anew\" sounds impossible when there's nothing to start with. like, how can i \"release the weight\" when the weight is the only thing left? everything feels so pointless. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i can finally stop feeling this way. does it ever actually get better, or do people just keep existing like ghosts forever?",
